        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we have launched various programs designed to integrate employee health and well-being into our culture through events, webinars, activities and fitness challenges.",
        "start_character": 24557,
        "end_character": 24735
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000789460-26-000015",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000789460-26-000015-b60b5112ce0b2a3e",
        "accession_number": "0000789460-26-000015",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a result of the military conflict in Eastern Europe, countries in which we operate have imposed economic sanctions, export controls, and other trade restrictions on Russia and Belarus and other individuals and entities with connections to the Russian and Belarusian nations.",
