        "filing_date": "2026-02-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In this regard, we are working on increasing transparency across our company, particularly around our talent recruitment, development and retention efforts and conducting comprehensive assessments of the strengths and growth opportunities for our employees.",
